    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this beautiful 4 bedroom dormer bungalow to the market.\n\nThis bright and spacious dormer bungalow is ideally situated in Brownstown Manor, Brownstown, Curragh, Co. Kildare. Offering well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this attractive home is perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nOn entering the property, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway leading to a generous  open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. This spacious room provides an excellent hub for everyday family life and entertaining, with plenty of natural light creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nThe ground floor also comprises a separate living room, utility room, guest WC and a versatile  downstairs bedroom, offering excellent flexibility for families, guests or those seeking single-level  accommodation. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms. The main bedroom benefits from its own ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a family bathroom.\n\nOne of the property's standout features is the large, sun-filled rear garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and family activities. The garden enjoys excellent natural light and offers plenty of scope for outdoor enjoyment.\n\nOverall, this is a well-presented and versatile family home, combining bright, spacious accommodation with a generous rear garden in a desirable residential setting.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Tiled flooring, under stairs storage, alarm point\n\nKitchen/Dining: Tiled flooring, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, oven, hob, extractor fan, double doors leading to living room and separate doors leading to rear garden\n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, worktop, fully fitted storage presses, back door leading to rear garden\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, recessed spot lights, feature fireplace with wrought iron insert and polished hearth\n\nGuest WC: Tiled flooring, WHB, WC, extractor fan\n\nMaster Bedroom: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nEnsuite: Lino flooring, shower unit, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe and vanity unit\n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4 (Downstairs): Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nFamily Bathroom: Lino flooring, bath, WHB, WC\n\nFeatures:\n\nFully alarmed\nPVC front door\nSelected carpets, blinds and light fittings included\nPVC double glazed windows\nOutside tap\nOutside lights\nPatio area to rear\nSide gates entrance to rear garden\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 2007\nc.171.66sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
      },
